    "Accessibility permission lets MeetingFocus read the windows of your meeting apps, which is how it can tell a real meeting from an open app. Without it, detection falls back to microphone activity alone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Bedienungshilfen-Berechtigung erlaubt MeetingFocus, die Fenster deiner Besprechungs-Apps zu lesen — so lässt sich eine echte Besprechung von einer bloß geöffneten App unterscheiden. Ohne sie bleibt nur die Mikrofonaktivität."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accessibility permission lets MeetingFocus read the windows of your meeting apps, which is how it can tell a real meeting from an open app. Without it, detection falls back to microphone activity alone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
